IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `toa-rules`

-- Independent tests, from independent-expectations.md (written before reading the rules).

GIVEN amt IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`officer total` amt `at` d MEANS `my allowances for` (`Transferred officer case` OF amt, d, FALSE)

GIVEN amt IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`widow total` amt `at` d MEANS `my allowances for` (`Transferred officer case` OF amt, d, TRUE)

